210/extras/6adacffccf87f984b383815ac619a09c.webm?t=1760484679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You play as a cat!</li><li>Talk, find items and befriend the SPACE ONION</li><li>Meet a cast of entertaining characters</li><li>No combat, unless you count smacking stuff with a baseball bat</li><li>An imaginative world</li><li>Takes 30-60 minutes to finish: You'll experience a lot in a short time!</li><li>A jazzy soundtrack</li><li>Secret cat things for curious cats</li><li>Made by one person</li><li>Enjoy chunky pixelart, with a grand total of 8 colors!</li><li>Cat</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.poster.avif?t=1760484679\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.webm?t=1760484679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781210/extras/ea6787d07b2e84448a65d0cc19bc6163.mp4?t=1760484679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
